  "name": "Jira: Set Fix Version and Release Link after Component Test Completed",
  "state": "ENABLED",
  "description": "CER-7533: Sets the issue's Fix Version property and a link to the release ticket in dependency of the component: \n- For Mediator and PostIdentService the fix version is determined from the sprint goal. The versions have to be included in the sprint goal in this pattern:\n<actual description of the goal>\nMediator <version>\nPostIdentService <version>\ne.g.\neArchiv\nMediator 1.33.0\nPostIdentService 2.11.0\n- All another components are handled as CeromaCore: the fix version is determined from the sprint number (X.XX -> X.XX.0)\n",
  "canOtherRuleTrigger": false,
  "notifyOnError": "FIRSTERROR",
